{\n    color: #f0592b;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .figure-placeholder {\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 70px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    border: 1px dashed #ccc;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">宝宝大脑发育<span class=\"accent\">从孕期抓起</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"col col1\">\n      <div class=\"pill-label\">基础期</div>\n      <div class=\"col-text\">大脑发育约</div>\n      <div class=\"percent\">50%-60%</div>\n      <div class=\"icon-row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-placeholder\">[胎儿<br>图标]</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-placeholder\">[头部<br>轮廓]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"age-range\">孕3个月~出生6个月</div>\n      <div class=\"stage-pill\">1阶段</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col col2\">\n      <div class=\"pill-label\">黄金期</div>\n      <div class=\"col-text\">大脑发育约</div>\n      <div class=\"percent\">60%-80%</div>\n      <div class=\"icon-row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-placeholder\">[头部<br>轮廓]</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-placeholder\">[头部<br>轮廓]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"age-range\">6个月~3岁</div>\n      <div class=\"stage-pill\">2阶段</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col col3\">\n      <div class=\"pill-label\">最后冲刺期</div>\n      <div class=\"col-text\">大脑发育约</div>\n      <div class=\"percent\">80%-90%</div>\n      <div class=\"icon-row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-placeholder\">[头部<br>轮廓]</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-placeholder\">[头部<br>轮廓]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"age-range\">3岁~6岁</div>\n      <div class=\"stage-pill\">3阶段</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-header\">宝宝大脑发育黄金期三个阶段</div>\n\n  <div class=\"block block1\">\n    <div class=\"block-text\">\n      <div class=\"block-title\">基础期：胎儿3个月-出生6月</div>\n      <div class=\"block-body\">\n        准妈妈每天额外补充：约200mg-250mg&nbsp;&nbsp;DHA。纯母乳宝宝不用额外补充，配方奶粉宝宝需选含有DHA成分的配方奶粉。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[插图：孕妇]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block block2\">\n    <div class=\"block-text\">\n      <div class=\"block-title\">黄金期：出生6个月-3岁</div>\n      <div class=\"block-body\">\n        宝宝的脑神经细胞还在不断增大，影响着宝宝的大脑神经信息的传递功能，神经元连接达到高峰，建议每日补充100-150mg&nbsp;&nbsp;DHA\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[插图：婴儿]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block block3\">\n    <div class=\"block-text\">\n      <div class=\"block-title\">冲刺期：3岁-6岁</div>\n      <div class=\"block-body\">\n        最后一个大脑黄金期，剩下10%~20%的脑部发育都将在此阶段进行冲刺，这个阶段完成后，孩子的智力基本达到成人水平，建议每日补充250mg DHA\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[插图：儿童+彩笔]</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
